<h1>Refund and Cancellation Policy</h1>
<p class="updated">Last updated: 1 Nov 2026</p>

<p>This page explains when you can get your money back and when you cannot. If anything is unclear, please ask us before you pay.</p>

<h2>Bach Flower consultation (Rs 1,000)</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Cancel 24 or more hours before your slot:</strong> full refund.</li>
<li><strong>Reschedule:</strong> you can move your booking once, free of charge.</li>
<li><strong>After the session has taken place:</strong> no refund.</li>
<li><strong>If we cancel or cannot hold your session:</strong> you can choose a full refund or a new slot at no charge.</li>
<li><strong>How refunds are paid:</strong> to the original payment method, within 5-7 working days.</li>
</ul>
<p>To cancel or reschedule, message or call us (see Contact below) with the name and number you booked under.</p>

<h2>Bach remedy bottle</h2>
<p>If you ask for a remedy bottle, it is billed separately from the consultation. If it arrives damaged in transit, we will refund or replace it. Please send us a photo and tell us as soon as you can after it arrives.</p>

<h2>Jyotish consultations</h2>
<p>Jyotish is donation-based. Any contribution is voluntary, so there is no refund process. If you contributed by mistake, for example the wrong amount or a duplicate payment, please contact us and we will look into it.</p>

<h2>Art of Living Happiness Program</h2>
<p>Registration and donations for the Happiness Program are made on the Art of Living site. Their refund and cancellation policy applies, and we cannot refund payments made to them.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Message us on <a href="https://wa.me/919985133161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> or call <a href="tel:+919985133161">+91 99851 33161</a>. Use the same number for questions, requests and complaints.</p>
<p>See also our <a href="terms.html">Terms of Use</a> and <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

